# Tests

Mirror the unit under test: Cubit and repository tests in `test/unit/`, pages in `test/widget/`, stable UI in `test/golden/`.

- Cubit tests use `bloc_test` and `SharedPreferences.setMockInitialValues`.
- Repository tests use `mocktail`. Assert failures as `Failure`, not raw exceptions.
- Widget tests pump `App` with explicit cubits and `AppRouter`. Register the repositories a screen reads from `getIt`. Assert copy from the English ARB.
- Golden tests use `alchemist` and render light and dark. Set `debugShowCheckedModeBanner: false`.
- Do not call the network or initialize Firebase. `injection_test.dart` checks registrations that do not construct Firebase.
- Refresh goldens with `flutter test --update-goldens`. macOS platform goldens differ by OS; CI goldens stay comparable.
